1
00:00:00,988 --> 00:00:04,058
(Sheldon:)If we did continue
living together,

2
00:00:04,058 --> 00:00:05,588
(Sheldon:)would it be here?

3
00:00:07,328 --> 00:00:08,428
(Leonard:)I don't know.

4
00:00:08,429 --> 00:00:10,529
It-It could be.

5
00:00:10,531 --> 00:00:11,461
(Sheldon:)Of course there's...

6
00:00:11,466 --> 00:00:13,996
(Sheldon:)there's always
your apartment.

7
00:00:14,001 --> 00:00:17,241
S-Sure, sure, we-we could
live in my apartment.

8
00:00:17,238 --> 00:00:19,638
(Sheldon:)I hate your apartment.

9
00:00:20,441 --> 00:00:23,141
(Amy:)Sorry, you brought it up?

10
00:00:23,144 --> 00:00:26,484
(Sheldon:)Well, I suppose we could
find a whole new place.

11
00:00:26,481 --> 00:00:27,681
(Sheldon:)You know, and, technically,

12
00:00:27,682 --> 00:00:29,352
(Sheldon:)we don't even have to stay
in Pasadena.

13
00:00:29,350 --> 00:00:32,250
(Sheldon:)We could, we could move
to Altadena...

14
00:00:32,253 --> 00:00:35,223
(Sheldon:)or a place that doesn't
even end in "Dena."

15
00:00:35,223 --> 00:00:36,953
(Amy:)It's kind of exciting.

16
00:00:36,958 --> 00:00:39,988
(Amy:)I mean... we could do
whatever we want.

17
00:00:40,828 --> 00:00:42,098
(Sheldon:)But what if we move

18
00:00:42,096 --> 00:00:43,896
(Sheldon:)and we don't like it?

19
00:00:43,898 --> 00:00:45,868
(Sheldon:)What if there's a smoker
in the building?

20
00:00:45,867 --> 00:00:46,967
(Sheldon:)Or pets?

21
00:00:46,968 --> 00:00:49,498
Or there could be mold.

22
00:00:49,504 --> 00:00:51,174
(Sheldon:)There could be traffic noise.

23
00:00:51,172 --> 00:01:00,022
(Sheldon:)I'm gonna have to learn
a whole new bus route.

